Non-brand paid search spend in Q3 2025 was about $1,303,935.84. This is the Google Ads campaign `FH_Search_NonBrand`, summed over the 13 weeks whose Monday falls between 2025-07-01 and 2025-09-30 (weeks of 2025-07-07 through 2025-09-29).

I treated "non-brand paid search" as that one campaign, since it's the only non-brand search campaign in the data. I didn't check Microsoft/Bing or other search platforms because there are no tables for them.

