The Upper Midwest sales area had 1,890 closed-won deals in 2025. That covers the MSP, RST, DLH, FAR and FSD regions.

I counted opportunities with stage "Closed Won" and a close date in 2025. I assigned each to a region through its lead record. Every one of the 10,117 closed-won deals in 2025 matched exactly one lead, so none were dropped or double-counted.

