I can't answer this from the data, because nothing in it says which channels are "performance-role."

The tables give spend by channel: Google search and YouTube, display, LinkedIn, Meta, CTV, partners and so on. None of them has a channel-role field, and the media plan notes don't assign roles either. Deciding which channels count as "performance" (for example, whether that includes non-brand search, Meta or affiliates) would be my own guess, and it would change the percentage. If you give me the list of channels in that role, or a role mapping, I can work out the 2023 share.

